text":"Multidisciplinary Teamwork"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Digital Teaching"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Learning Analytics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI Literacy"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Recognized Special-Education Qualification","School Practicum","Applicable Professional Registration/Eligibility","Resource Teacher","Disability-Specific Expertise","Senior Resource Teacher","Inclusion Coordinator","Special Education Program Head"]},{"type":"p","text":"For maximum employability, combine special-education pedagogy + assessment + individualized planning + differentiated instruction + assistive technology + family collaboration + inclusive classroom management + digital accessibility."},{"type":"note","label":"Career-fitment mapping note","text":"This career should be treated differently from a general school-teacher pathway. A Resource Teacher/Special Educator position may require specific recognized special-education qualifications and professional registration. For an India-focused database, the roadmap should explicitly direct students to verify current RCI recognition/registration and the exact recruitment requirements of the school or education authority."}]}]}